# The staff scanner has no Cloud API, student account, or attendee wallet settings.
# It connects only to the Event Node URL entered by staff at pairing or sign-in.
#
# The isolated LAN-demo APK receives its public CA certificate through an EAS
# File environment variable named INGRESS_LAN_DEMO_CA_CERT. Do not place a CA
# private key or certificate authority file in this project environment file.
